THINKING:  
The GO term is "mansosylglycerate synthase activity" with the definition that it catalyzes the reaction: GDP-alpha-D-mannose + D-glycerate = H+ + 2-(alpha-D-mannosyl)-D-glycerate + GDP. The primary reaction involves the transfer of a phosphate group from GDP-alpha-D-mannose to D-glycerate, forming mannosylglycerate and releasing GDP.  

